<title>SPAIN: FORECAST -Iberdrola 96 net seen up 14.6 pct.</title>
<headline>FORECAST -Iberdrola 96 net seen up 14.6 pct.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Market forecasts for 1996 results of Spanish utility group Iberdrola. Simple averages of analysts' forecasts. In billion of pesetas.</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995	    RANGE</p>
<p>    Operating income	829.85     819.16    859.87-809.36</p>
<p>    Net attributable	 97.42	85.01    99.21- 95.00</p>
<p>Contributors: AB Asesores, ABN-Amro, Ahorro Corporacion, Benito y Monjardin, Beta Capital, Credit Lyonnais, Ibersecurities.</p>
<p>Iberdrola plans to release its results in mid-February.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom + 34 1 585-2167</p>
</text>
